      "id": "claim_935a9971500447bd90ddd7eee1f0f20e",
      "statement": "DocumentationBuilder.copy_extensions defines 23 supported file types including .mdx, .md, .json, images (.png, .jpg, .gif), video (.mp4, .webm), fonts (.woff2, .ttf), components (.jsx, .tsx), and config files (.yml, .yaml, .js, .css, .html). Files not in this set are silently skipped during build operations.",
