      "statement": "Shared snippets are emitted in three forms: a default path (snippets/example.mdx) with Python-prefixed absolute links for unversioned importers, a Python copy (snippets/python/example.mdx), and a JavaScript copy (snippets/javascript/example.mdx). The default allows unversioned pages like LangSmith to import without specifying language.",
