      "id": "claim_f379939972414d33b010bcb383372a2b",
      "statement": "Markdown files (.md, .mdx) are preprocessed via _process_markdown_file(): content is read, preprocess_markdown() applies cross-reference resolution and conditional block filtering per target_language, links are rewritten, an 'Edit Source' GitHub link is appended (except for root index.mdx and snippets), and .md is converted to .mdx. Errors are logged but do not halt the build.",
