      "id": "claim_92ac0629bf864e0fa56666af95d48811",
      "statement": "_safe_source_files() rejects symlinks even when they target regular files to prevent host-path exfiltration (e.g., /proc/self/environ). Symlinks are logged as warnings and excluded from the file collection. Resolved paths must stay within the specified root or they are also rejected.",
