      "id": "claim_2e717221e2b84ef895a138c23f6ab256",
      "statement": "_generate_llms_txt() produces a custom index to override Mintlify's 100,000-character truncation. It indexes all .mdx files, extracts frontmatter (title, description), excludes noindex pages and snippets, and splits large sections into indexed sub-files at <section>/llms.txt. Root file delegates to section indexes via markdown links.",
