      "id": "claim_8a91950cba374dfa8a34d8e955976690",
      "statement": "_openapi_entries() derives pages from OpenAPI specs referenced in docs.json by walking the navigation tree, finding all openapi blocks, reading each spec, and generating slug entries. For each operation: it generates <directory>/<tag>/<summary> slug, handles duplicate summaries with numeric suffixes, and skips hidden operations (x-hidden: true).",
