      "id": "claim_0359065f95164806ac2809c884abbfed",
      "statement": "_generate_llms_full_txt() produces a complete-text corpus by collecting all .mdx pages (excluding snippets and noindex), reading and inlining snippet imports so agents see full content, and splitting language variants into separate files (oss/python/llms-full.txt and oss/javascript/llms-full.txt). Root file opens with site title and links to language splits.",
