      "statement": "_copy_npm_snippets() copies pre-built React components from @langchain/docs-sandbox npm package, overwriting source-tree versions to always use the latest published. It maps npm filenames to build paths: PatternEmbed.jsx → build/snippets/pattern-embed.jsx, ExampleEmbed.jsx → build/snippets/example-embed.jsx, ChatLangChainEmbed.js → build/ChatLangChainEmbed.js.",
