      "id": "claim_75814812b61f44359f9dba1abddb357e",
      "statement": "The file_system(files: list[File]) context manager from tests/unit_tests/utils.py creates isolated test environments: it creates a temp directory with src/ and build/ subdirectories, populates src/ with File TypedDicts (each with path and either content or bytes), provides list_build_files() and build_file_exists() methods, and cleans up automatically on exit.",
