      "id": "claim_67171363bdcb4e0a8eda2799efcde1e3",
      "statement": "_slugify() converts text to URL-safe slugs (lowercase, hyphenate, strip) and drops apostrophes to match Mintlify behavior. _tag_slug() slugs OpenAPI tags while preserving underscores (unlike _slugify) because LangSmith spec carries both annotation-queues and annotation_queues as distinct tags requiring different URLs.",
