    {
      "id": "claim_8c82534ceb8b4a0a9f5c7de236454249",
      "statement": "DocumentationBuilder provides three build entry points: build_all() clears the build directory and runs the full pipeline (versioned OSS, unversioned products, shared files, npm snippets, llms.txt generation); build_file(path) builds one file with version-aware routing (OSS files split per language, others build once); build_files(paths) builds multiple files showing a progress bar (hidden in CI).",
